{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run your dream sushi restaurant in a wild and cheeky simulation like no other!</strong> \ud83c\udf63</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Body Sushi</i>, a bold sushi restaurant simulator where your creativity, management skills, and a touch of mischief collide. Build, customize, and grow your sushi business\u2014but disaster strikes on opening day!\u00a0 Will you rise from the chaos or be served raw?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the owner, you'll prepare perfect sushi, manage the restaurant flow, and meet colorful, quirky characters with wild personalities and their own demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge variety of sushi styles to master!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/5f20e7516ee8a7706138716c2936e165.poster.avif?t=1759006633\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/5f20e7516ee8a7706138716c2936e165.webm?t=1759006633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/5f20e7516ee8a7706138716c2936e165.mp4?t=1759006633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/7cd8c30c74c3d9d27e2fa7e0a0713d0d.poster.avif?t=1759006633\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430330/extras/7cd8c30c74c3d9d27e2fa7e0a0713d0d.webm?t=1759006633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass